**[Click here to open Music Taste Intelligence](PASTE_YOUR_STREAMLIT_APP_URL_HERE)**

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Streamlit
- Pandas & NumPy
- Scikit-learn
- PCA
- K-Means Clustering
- DBSCAN
- Hierarchical Clustering

## Features
- Music track discovery
- Similar music recommendations
- Interactive dashboard
- Cluster analysis and visualization
- Audio feature analysis
